OL,3,GNEWSATory deputy leader Alex Burghart
OL,4,Afaces questions from BBC local radio
OL,5,Astations
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative deputy leader Alex
OL,8,FBurghart is taking part in a series of
OL,9,Fquick-fire interviews on BBC local
OL,10,Fradio stations
OL,12,FHis party is preparing to host its
OL,13,Fautumn conference, which takes place in
OL,14,FBirmingham from Sunday
OL,16,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,17,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,18,Fyears. Leaders of other major
OL,19,FWestminster parties have had a similar
OL,20,Fopportunity before their conferences
